  "description": "OpenTokVideoView, a .NET MAUI view that renders an OpenTok publisher's camera preview or a subscriber's remote video, over the cross-platform OpenTok.Net API. Handles the part every OpenTok MAUI app otherwise writes twice: OpenTok hands its render view out of the SDK rather than taking one in, so the view has to be attached into a container after the fact. Call UseOpenTok() in MauiProgram.",
